          },
          "author": "Slumberkins",
          "description": "It’s never too early to teach children about mindfulness! Whether your kids are at home, on the go, or at school, these mini meditations are an easy way to get children to calm their active bodies alongside fun and friendly forest creatures. Each meditation was developed by therapists and educators at Slumberkins, the leading brand for early emotional learning.   \n\nThis series of Mini Meditations includes:   \n• Deep Breathing with Frog  \n• Explore the Senses with Bunny \n• Flex your Muscles with Snail \n• Listen and Imagine with Dragonfly",
